      </div>
      <p class="catalog-section-kicker">House brand, co-brand, and OEM programs. Sold only through vetted retailers — never direct to consumers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="aisle-grid">
      <!-- A2: each card links to /collections/consumer#{aisle} with exact icon SVGs from consumer page -->
