<!-- ============================================================
     §08 HOW WE WORK — operating principles
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="block" id="principles">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="section-head-meta">
      <span class="section-num">08</span>
      <span class="section-rule"></span>
      <span class="section-label">HOW WE WORK · OPERATING PRINCIPLES</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Four rules that decide everything else.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="principles-grid">
    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-n">01</div>
      <h4 class="principle-title">The part number is the hero.</h4>
      <p class="principle-body">A contractor on a Friday afternoon does not need a marketing story; they need a SKU they can read off a shelf, type into a quote tool, and reorder Monday. We design packaging, catalogs, and websites around that one act.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-n">02</div>
      <h4 class="principle-title">The shelf decides.</h4>
      <p class="principle-body">If a SKU does not move at the shelf — physical or specified — it does not get a generation-two refresh. We do not subsidize loyalty to our own platforms. The catalog is pruned annually, not grown.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-n">03</div>
      <h4 class="principle-title">Two channels, one catalog.</h4>
      <p class="principle-body">Retail and Spec are commercially separate, but technically unified. The same driver platform, the same connector library, the same warranty discipline. A failure mode learned in one channel patches both.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-n">04</div>
      <h4 class="principle-title">Engineered in California. Built where it ships best.</h4>
      <p class="principle-body">US production for branded volume that needs short cycles. Global manufacturing — United States, Mexico, China, Thailand — for programs that need scale. All production is built to ALG engineering specifications and reports to the same QA log. Country of origin is stated on every product and its documentation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     §09 TIMELINE — 30 years
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="block" id="timeline">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="section-head-meta">
      <span class="section-num">09</span>
      <span class="section-rule"></span>
      <span class="section-label">TIMELINE · 30 YEARS</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-title">From retail OEM floor to a two-catalog manufacturer.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="timeline-rail"></div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">1997</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">Founded in Montclair, CA</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">Archipelago Lighting Group incorporates as an OEM and white-label lighting manufacturer.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">2001</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">First national retail program</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">First passed line review at a national home retailer. The retail compliance discipline takes hold.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">2008</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">Five-warehouse US footprint</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">Distribution build-out gives ALG same-week replenishment on in-season retail SKUs.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">2012</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">PolyGrow horticultural launches</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">First retail sub-brand built for the garden aisle — supplemental grow + accent lighting.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">2015</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">Riverside production opens</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">9345 Sycamore Canyon Blvd. Driver assembly + final QA brought in-house for branded C&amp;I product.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">2018</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">plano<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>RCH · lampar<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>RCH ship</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">First branded commercial &amp; industrial SKUs ship under the <span class="aa">Ⓐ</span> family. Sold only through authorized channels.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">2021</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">contr<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>LS launches</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">BLE-mesh networked controls platform. DLC NLC5 listed. No gateway, no cloud lock.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">2014</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">Two-channel structure formalized</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">Retail and C&amp;I split into independent commercial orgs. Separate price books, separate sales teams, shared engineering.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-row">
      <div class="timeline-year">Now</div>
      <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-title">Distributor + AURA portals live</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">Direct-to-distributor portal with rebate calc + IES on demand. AURA rep portal goes live.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

